# Description
Simulated brute force login attacks on Windows 10 endpoints by generating repeated failed login attempts (Event ID 4625).Configured Splunk Universal Forwarder
to collect Windows Security event logs and developed SPL queries to detect failed login patterns exceeding thresholds within 5‑minute windows.Built real‑time
Splunk alert rules to trigger on brute force detection and notify security teams.Designed a 4‑panel Splunk dashboard visualizing attack timelines, failed vs. 
successful login activity, and documented findings in a structured incident report.






